      "block_id": "2605.24807_p7_b1",
      "text": "Fig. 3: Overall integration framework. CLIP extracts text and image embeddings,\nwhich produce similarity features and maps via cosine similarity. Points prompts are\nderived either from similarity masks or GT labels, depending on our design mode\n(manual or semi-automatic), while text, vision, and similarity features are injected\ninto SAM through our semantic adapter modules.\n",
